// MARK: - v0.3.0 help
"Unelte" = "Tools";
"Photo2Mac este un editor de imagini nativ macOS, simplu si rapid. Editarea e nedistructiva: decuparea, rotirea, oglindirea, ajustarile si redimensionarea sunt pasi intr-o stiva de editari, randata live prin Core Image; pixelii se schimba abia la salvare." = "Photo2Mac is a simple, fast, native macOS image editor. Editing is non-destructive: cropping, rotating, flipping, adjustments and resizing are steps in an edit stack rendered live through Core Image; the pixels change only when you save.";
"Ce face Cmd+S alegi in Preferinte > Salvare: fisierul devine imaginea editata, originalul ramane neatins cu editarile intr-un fisier .p2m alaturi, sau fisierul editat poarta originalul in interior. In ultimele doua cazuri, redeschiderea in Photo2Mac aduce inapoi editarile, pe care le poti modifica." = "You choose what Cmd+S does in Settings > Saving: the file becomes the edited image, the original stays untouched with the edits in a .p2m file next to it, or the edited file carries the original inside. In the last two cases, reopening in Photo2Mac brings the edits back and you can change them.";
"Fisier > Deschide imagine... (Cmd+O), trage o imagine pe fereastra sau alege una recenta din ecranul de pornire." = "File > Open Image... (Cmd+O), drag an image onto the window, or pick a recent one on the start screen.";
"Imaginile deschise apar ca taburi; un punct langa nume inseamna modificari nesalvate. Cmd+W inchide tabul, iar inchiderea ultimului tab sau a ferestrei inchide aplicatia. Daca ai modificari nesalvate, esti intrebat inainte." = "Open images appear as tabs; a dot next to the name means unsaved changes. Cmd+W closes the tab, and closing the last tab or the window quits the app. With unsaved changes you are asked first.";
"Sagetile stanga / dreapta (dupa un click pe imagine) sau Cmd+[ / Cmd+] deschid imaginea anterioara / urmatoare din acelasi dosar. Tabul curent e inlocuit doar daca nu are modificari nesalvate." = "Left / right arrows (after clicking the image) or Cmd+[ / Cmd+] open the previous / next image in the same folder. The current tab is replaced only if it has no unsaved changes.";
"Mutare: muti imaginea (click-drag sau scroll pe trackpad), pinch pentru zoom." = "Move: pan the image (click-drag or trackpad scroll), pinch to zoom.";
"Decupare: dreptunghi cu manere in colturi si pe laturi, raport fix sau liber. Return aplica, Escape renunta, si cu inspectorul ascuns. Decuparea ramane pe acelasi subiect daca rotesti imaginea dupa aceea." = "Crop: a rectangle with corner and edge handles, fixed or free ratio. Return applies, Escape cancels, also with the inspector hidden. The crop stays on the same subject if you rotate the image afterwards.";
"Rotire: ±90°, unghi fin cu pas de 0,01° (slider, camp sau doua degete pe trackpad) si oglindire orizontala / verticala a imaginii asa cum o vezi." = "Rotate: ±90°, fine angle in 0.01° steps (slider, field or two fingers on the trackpad), and horizontal / vertical flip of the image as you see it.";
"Ajustari: histograma live (Luminanta / RGB / R / G / B) si Luminozitate, Contrast, Saturatie, Expunere." = "Adjustments: live histogram (Luminance / RGB / R / G / B) and Brightness, Contrast, Saturation, Exposure.";
"Redimensionare: latime si inaltime in pixeli sau procent, cu proportiile pastrate, plus latura lunga 1920 / 1200 / 800. Se aplica ultima, deci o poti schimba sau scoate oricand." = "Resize: width and height in pixels or percent, keeping proportions, plus long edge 1920 / 1200 / 800. It is applied last, so you can change or remove it at any time.";
"Metadate: EXIF (camera, ISO, expunere etc.) si ce a scris Photo2Mac in XMP." = "Metadata: EXIF (camera, ISO, exposure etc.) and what Photo2Mac wrote to XMP.";
"Inainte / dupa: tine apasat butonul din toolbar sau tasta \\ ca sa vezi originalul." = "Before / after: hold the toolbar button or the \\ key to see the original.";
"Cmd+S salveaza peste fisier, in modul ales in Preferinte. macOS pastreaza si versiunea dinainte; o recuperezi deschizand fisierul in Preview, Fisier > Revino la." = "Cmd+S saves over the file, in the mode chosen in Settings. macOS also keeps the previous version; recover it by opening the file in Preview, File > Revert To.";
"Fisierul devine imaginea editata, ca in Preview. Alte aplicatii vad editarile. macOS pastreaza versiunea dinainte: o recuperezi deschizand fisierul in Preview, Fisier > Revino la." = "The file becomes the edited image, as in Preview. Other apps see the edits. macOS keeps the previous version: recover it by opening the file in Preview, File > Revert To.";
"Cmd+Shift+S salveaza intr-un fisier nou, iar documentul trece pe fisierul nou." = "Cmd+Shift+S saves to a new file, and the document moves to the new file.";
"Cmd+Shift+E exporta o copie: alegi formatul (JPEG, PNG, HEIC, TIFF), calitatea si o latura maxima. Documentul ramane cum era." = "Cmd+Shift+E exports a copy: choose the format (JPEG, PNG, HEIC, TIFF), the quality and a maximum side. The document stays as it was.";
"Editarile nesalvate sunt pastrate automat. Daca aplicatia se inchide neasteptat, la redeschiderea imaginii esti intrebat daca le continui; daca fisierul s-a schimbat intre timp, nu ti le mai propune." = "Unsaved edits are kept automatically. If the app quits unexpectedly, reopening the image asks whether to continue them; if the file changed in the meantime, they are not offered.";
"In Rotire, Ajustari si Redimensionare, tot ce faci pana la Aplica e un singur pas de undo (Cmd+Z)." = "In Rotate, Adjustments and Resize, everything you do until Apply is a single undo step (Cmd+Z).";
"Butonul Editari din toolbar arata lista editarilor aplicate; X scoate doar pasul respectiv." = "The Edits button in the toolbar lists the applied edits; X removes just that step.";
"La intrarea in Decupare zoom-ul scade cu 10%, ca sa ajungi usor la colturi." = "Entering Crop zooms out by 10% so the corners are easy to reach.";
"Urmeaza: anotari (text, sageata, dreptunghi, blur), procesare in lot, RAW." = "Coming next: annotations (text, arrow, rectangle, blur), batch processing, RAW.";
"Salvarea scrie 8 biti pe canal: o imagine de 16 biti pierde adancimea de culoare la salvare." = "Saving writes 8 bits per channel: a 16-bit image loses its colour depth when saved.";
"Raportul Original = raportul imaginii asa cum arata dupa rotire." = "The Original ratio is the image's ratio as it looks after rotation.";
"Containere: JPEG (APP1), PNG (iTXt), HEIC (meta box), TIFF (tag 700). Se mai scriu xmp:CreatorTool si dc:description (rezumat in engleza), ca editarile sa se vada in orice viewer (Preview, exiftool, Bridge, Get Info). Alaturi: p2m:saveMode (cum a fost scris fisierul) si, in modul care pastreaza originalul, p2m:originalImage, p2m:originalType si p2m:originalSHA256." = "Containers: JPEG (APP1), PNG (iTXt), HEIC (meta box), TIFF (tag 700). xmp:CreatorTool and dc:description (an English summary) are written too, so the edits show in any viewer (Preview, exiftool, Bridge, Get Info). Alongside: p2m:saveMode (how the file was written) and, in the mode that keeps the original, p2m:originalImage, p2m:originalType and p2m:originalSHA256.";
"Ordine de randare: flipH → flipV → rotate → crop → adjustments → resize. Crop-ul lucreaza pe cadrul rotit, la unghiul din cropBasisDegrees; ajustarile pe regiunea decupata; resize pe rezultat." = "Render order: flipH → flipV → rotate → crop → adjustments → resize. The crop works on the rotated frame at the angle in cropBasisDegrees, adjustments on the cropped region, resize on the result.";
"exporta o copie" = "export a copy";
"imaginea anterioara / urmatoare din dosar" = "previous / next image in the folder";
"aplica / renunta in unealta curenta" = "apply / cancel in the current tool";
"tine apasat: originalul" = "hold: the original";

